--- REFUND ---

Up until summer 2025 all readings used by Octopus for billing were estimates.

I later provided an actual meter reading on 16 June 2025 (with photographic evidence).

The rebilling was applied in the statement dated 30 June 2025, covering the period 1 October 2024 to 15 June 2025.

Prior to the correction, billing for the period December 2024 to March 2025 was based entirely on estimated readings and showed materially elevated usage levels.

Given that this period coincided with very high gas unit rates, I was concerned that any refund be calculated correctly across the full period of overestimation.

I requested a clear explanation of how the refund was calculated.

An initial response indicated that the full period and range of rates would be taken into account.

However, no clear explanation of the calculation methodology was subsequently provided.

The resulting rebilling process was complex and required significant effort to reconstruct.

